SKIP_REASON file_alloc_failure_hook file.hp's constructor and file_temp() use fopen()/tmpfile() directly and perform no stdlib_alloc/stdlib_calloc, so there is no allocation path for stdlib_alloc_fail_at/after to reach; no honest OOM test can be fabricated (DEEP_FILE_CONTRACT.md #9).
